{title: Aaiye Meherbaan}
{artist: Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Aaiye meherbaan
[C]baithiye [F]jaane jaan
[F]Shauk [G]se liijiyegi
[C]ishq ki imthihaan
[C]Aaiye meherbaan
[C]Kaise ho [F]tum naujwaan
[F]kitne [C]haseen mehmaan
[C]Kaise karun [F]mein bayaan
[G]dil ki [C]nahi hai zubaan
[C]Aaiye meherbaan...
[C]Dekha machal [F]ke jidhar
[F]bijli gira [C]di udhar
[C]Kis ka [F]jala aashiyana
[G]bijli ko [C]ye kya khabar
[C]Aaiye meherbaan...
